{"title": "Silver Ingot", "pageid": 8773, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Silver_Ingot", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Silver_Ingot_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Silver_Ingot_Faded.png/300px-Silver_Ingot_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/7/74/Silver_Ingot_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Silver Ingot image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Silver_Ingot_Faded.png/300px-Silver_Ingot_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Silver_Ingot_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Silver ingot</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Valuables\" title=\"Valuables\">Valuable</a> that is primarily sold for <a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a> or bartered to <a href=\"/wiki/Traders\" title=\"Traders\">Traders</a>.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquot